== Notes ==
* This spell will strip the [[concealment]] granted by ''[[improved invisibility]]'' even if the subject is no longer under the invisibility aspect of that spell.
* The purge occurs when a creature transitions from outside the affected area to inside. This includes a creature moving into the affected area, the affected area moving onto a creature, and the affected area coming into existence over a creature. Once inside, a creature can become invisible and remain so as long as the creature does not (exit and) re-enter the affected area.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''invisibility'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

=== Previous versions ===
* Prior to version 1.66, this spell did not remove the assassin's ''[[improved invisibility (feat)|improved invisibility]]''.

